            <span data-line="sixteen" hidden>Now the names make sense.</span>
            <span data-line="seventeen" hidden>That fourth party can depend on someone else.</span>
            <span data-line="eighteen" hidden>One door. Many others behind it.</span>
            <span data-line="nineteen" hidden>This is a supply chain.</span>
            <span data-line="twenty" hidden>The door didn't change.</span>
            <span data-line="twentyone" hidden>A problem there can become a problem here.</span>
            <span data-line="twentytwo" hidden>This is supply chain risk.</span>
            <span data-line="twentythree" hidden>The door was only the easy example.</span>
            <span data-line="twentyfour" hidden>What you trust changes with them.</span>
            <span data-line="twentyfive" hidden>Different problems. Different names.</span>
            <span data-line="twentysix" hidden>Now the system can make a judgement.</span>
            <span data-line="twentyseven" hidden>Before, you trusted things to work.</span>
            <span data-line="twentyeight" hidden>This is where AI enters the story.</span>
            <span data-line="twentynine" hidden>Now you trust the decision too.</span>
            <span data-line="thirty" hidden>AI changes the security question.</span>
            <span data-line="thirtyone" hidden>Different names. Same pattern.</span>

            <span data-line="thirtytwo" hidden>
              <span>Security didn't keep changing.</span>
              <span>What you trusted did.</span>
            </span>
          </h1>

          <p class="door__sub" data-line="one">
            And you probably didn't notice when it happened.
          </p>

          <!-- Three steps in the order they happen, each on its own line,
               so the sequence reads as a sequence rather than a sentence. -->
          <p class="door__sub door__steps" data-line="two" hidden>
            <span>You close the door.</span>
            <span>You lock it.</span>
            <span>Then you walk away.</span>
          </p>

          <p class="door__sub door__steps" data-line="three" hidden>
            <span>You don't stay behind to guard the door.</span>
            <span>You expect the lock to do its job after you've walked away.</span>
          </p>

          <p class="door__sub door__steps" data-line="four" hidden>
            <span>You call a plumber.</span>
            <span>You won't be home when he arrives.</span>
            <span>So you leave him a key.</span>
          </p>

          <p class="door__sub door__steps" data-line="five" hidden>
