          Now look back at where we started <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </button>

        <button type="button" class="door__turn" data-line="thirtyone" data-onward31 hidden>
          Now read the first line again <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </button>

        <a class="door__again" href="/explore/" data-line="thirtytwo" hidden>
